----------------------------------------------------------------------
Japanese romaji generated with wanakana (MIT, https://github.com/WaniKani/WanaKana).

Mincho font: subset of Noto Serif CJK JP, (c) Google / Adobe, SIL Open Font
License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org). Newsreader and Outfit fonts via
@fontsource, SIL Open Font License 1.1.

Kana audio (public/audio/kana) generated with Microsoft Edge text-to-speech
(voice ja-JP-NanamiNeural) via edge-tts; see scripts/make-kana-audio.mjs.
Online word audio is streamed at runtime from Youdao dictvoice and is not
redistributed with this app.
